        "L5: update_pcf ticker=NVDA quantity_per_cu=1800.0 (was 1800) basis_doc=nvda-8k-20240607 memo='NVDA 10-for-1 forward split effective 2024-06-07 (Certificate of Amendment, Exhibit 3.1). PCF updated from 180 shares/CU (pre-split) to 1,800 shares/CU (post-split) for 2024-06-10 dissemination. 18,000 pre-split shares × 10 = 180,000 post-split; 180,000 ÷ 100 CUs = 1,800/CU.'",
